//! Integration tests for the async export-job path (item 6 of the export epic,
//! ADR-0003): `POST .../entities/export` with `async: true` and the
//! `GET .../exports/{job_id}` status endpoint.
//!
//! In-process SurrealDB (`mem://`); storage is mocked with an in-memory
//! [`MockStore`] — no live MinIO/S3. The full lifecycle test drives the
//! [`ExportJobActor`] directly with a mock store so the generated bytes and the
//! `queued -> running -> complete` transitions are observable without a real
//! object store; the HTTP tests cover the 202-queued accept, the no-storage
//! refusal, and the schema-scoped status gate.

